      "items": [
       {
        "title": "Day 1 - Smart Manufacturing. Made Simple.",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p><strong>08:30 am - 9:00 am</strong><br/><strong>Registration and Networking</strong></p> <hr/> <p><strong>09:00 am - 9:30 am</strong><br/><strong>Welcome &amp; Opening Remarks - Keynote Address</strong><br/>Delivering Efficiency at Scale: Turning Smart Manufacturing into Reality <br/>Alexander Zoller - President, ZOLLER Inc.</p> <hr/> <p><strong>09:30 am - 10:00 am</strong><br/><strong>Customer Keynote</strong><br/>Discipline Drives Performance: Building a High-Performing Machine Shop<br/>Peter Doyle – President, Hirsh Precision</p> <hr/> <p><strong>10:00 am - 10:30 am</strong><br/><strong>Guest Speaker</strong><br/>Winner of the 2024 ZOLLER ToolRoom of the Year Award presents “The Smart Factory Next Door”<br/>Max Egan - President, Atlas Fibre</p> <hr/> <p><strong>10:30 am - 10:45 am</strong><br/><strong>Networking Break</strong></p> <hr/> <p><strong>11:15 am – 11:45 am</strong><br/><strong>Roadmapping Efficiency - Start with a Solution. Enter a System.</strong><br/>How ZOLLER Solutions create a closed-loop system from tool preparation to the CNC machine.<br/><br/><strong>Panel Discussion</strong><br/>The ZOLLER 2026 ToolRoom of the Year Award - What Makes a Winner? </p> <hr/> <p><strong>12:00 pm - 01:00 pm</strong><br/><strong>Traditional German</strong> <strong>Lunch and Networking with ZOLLER Experts</strong></p> <hr/> <p><strong>01:00 pm - 01:30 pm</strong><br/><strong>Smart Forecasting - Manufacturing Outlook for Aerospace </strong><br/>Eric Brothers, Senior Editor, GIE Media<br/><br/><strong>Breakout Sessions, Round 1</strong><br/><strong>1:30 pm - 2:00 pm </strong><br/>Track 1 - Optimizing Efficiency with ZOLLER TMS from CAM to Part<br/><strong>2:00 - 2:30 pm </strong><br/>Track 2 - Automating the Toolroom: A Step-by-Step Approach</p> <hr/> <p><strong>02:30 pm - 02:45 pm</strong><br/><strong>Coffee &amp; Networking Break</strong></p> <hr/> <p><strong>02:45 pm - 04:00 pm</strong><br/><strong>Breakout Sessions – Round 2</strong></p> <p>Track 1 – ZOLLER TMS Advanced Features &amp; Smart Inventory Management (Presentation &amp; Demo)<br/>Track 2 – Heat Shrink &amp; Balancing - The Why's and How's (Presentation &amp; Demo)<br/>Track 3 – From Scan to Spindle: Smart Data Transfer Made Simple (Presentation &amp; Demo)</p> <hr/> <p><strong>04:00 pm - 04:15 pm</strong><br/><strong>Day 1 Wrap-Up &amp; Summary</strong><br/>Alexander Zoller, President, ZOLLER Inc.</p> <hr/> <p><strong>04:15 pm - 07:00 pm</strong><br/><strong>Happy Hour &amp; Networking Reception</strong><br/>Live music, appetizers, and informal networking with speakers and ZOLLER experts</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textmedia",
          "id": "c7388",
          "bg": "lightgray",
