           "before": "small",
           "after": "small"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Day 2 – Smart Manufacturing Made Simple: Putting It Into Practice",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p><strong>09:00 am - 09:30 am</strong><br/><strong>Keynote Address</strong><br/>“The Reality of Lot Size 1: Scaling Individualized Production”<br/>Alexander Zoller, President of ZOLLER Inc.</p> <hr/> <p><strong>09:30 am - 10:00 am</strong><br/><strong>Keynote Address</strong><br/>“From Strategy to Shop Floor: Industry 4.0 at Scale”<br/>Walt Swenton, Senior Manager, Advanced Manufacturing/Industry 4.0 for the Eaton Aerospace Group</p> <hr/> <p><strong>10:00 am - 10:15 am</strong><br/><strong>Networking Break</strong></p> <hr/> <p><strong>10:15 am - 10:45 am</strong><br/><strong>Efficiency That Pays: Turning Toolroom Investment into Revenue Growth</strong><br/>Tom Bassett, President Pro-Cam LLC.</p> <hr/> <p><strong>10:45 am - 11:30 am</strong><br/><strong>Tool Inspection in Action: Driving Performance &amp; Precision Customer Panel</strong><br/>John Leppinen II, Vice President Garr Tool<br/>Frank Weisskopf, President TTS<br/>Werner Lueken, Director of Tool Inspection, ZOLLER Inc.</p> <hr/> <p><strong>11:30 am -12:00 pm</strong><br/><strong>From Data to Lights-Out: Building a Smarter, Scalable Grinding Operation with Connected Systems</strong><br/>Sam Kirkpatrick, Product Manager, ANCA CNC</p> <hr/> <p><strong>12:00 pm - 01:00 pm</strong><br/><strong>Lunch</strong><br/>German Cuisine Buffet</p> <hr/> <p><strong>01:00 pm - 01:30 pm</strong><br/><strong>“Automation in Action: What It Really Takes to Implement Industry 4.0” Panel Discussion</strong><br/>Host: “Lights Out” Podcast Host Nick Goellner <br/>Panel: Markus Lewandowski, ZOLLER Inc. / Dietmar Moll, ZOLLER Inc. / Audience Participation</p> <hr/> <p><strong>01:30 pm - 04:00 pm</strong><br/><strong>Breakout Sessions</strong><br/>Presetting That Delivers: Finding the Right Fit for Your Shop<br/>Why Balancing Matters: Stability, Accuracy, and Tool Life<br/>Getting the Most from Your Tools: The Importance of the Right Holder<br/>Heat Shrinking in Practice: Precision Clamping for Reliable Results<br/>Connecting It All: Building an Integrated Toolroom with ZOLLER</p> <hr/> <p><strong>02:15 pm - 02:30 pm</strong><br/><strong>Coffee &amp; Networking Break</strong></p> <hr/> <p><strong>04:00 pm - 4:15 pm</strong><br/><strong>Manufacturing Summit Close Out and Final Remarks</strong><br/>Alexander Zoller, President, ZOLLER Inc.</p> <hr/> <p><strong>04:30 pm - 08:00 pm</strong><br/><strong>Happy Hour, BBQ, and Live Music with Visitors, Family, and Friends</strong></p> <hr/> <p><strong>All Day: </strong></p><ul><li>Live Demos of all ZOLLER Solutions</li><li>Meetings with ZOLLER Experts and Visits to Partner Tabletops of OEM Machine Tool Partners (ANCA, HERMLE, SW, CHIRON, GROB)</li></ul>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
